  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Long ago, an emperor suddenly decided to execute the members of his court. Only after being offered a girl named Ae-Hwa, did the emperor’s rampage stop. The emperor cherishes his “flower” dearly. When Ae-Hwa expresses an interest in music, the Emperor makes Ha-Rang Kang her personal court musician. However, the emperor decreed that only he can lay eyes on Ae-Hwa and has Ha-Rang’s eyes destroyed. After finding out the true cause of his father’s death, Ha-Rang swears revenge on both Ae-Hwa and the Emperor. In this twisted realm of snakes and flowers, who will prevail? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes 1 extra chapter.*",
